{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他想起从前自然亲近的日子，心里重新热起来，也有了把往后日子过好的劲头。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"怀念、回暖、期待、重新振作\",\n      \"missed\": \"他其实还怕要等很久才能遇到亲近的人，以及即使一直没有也要好好生活、不再为了留人吞下委屈的完整态度。这些藏在较长的紫色和绿色句子里，需要继续读。第一段下面的小号音乐说明也不容易一眼读完。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他被过去亲近的回忆重新带起劲头，想向前生活，不再整天跟过去的事情较劲。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"振奋、急切、心跳加速、向前冲\",\n      \"missed\": \"劲头之后仍然存在的担忧，以及最后决定不再委屈自己的态度，需要看紫色和绿色段落才能完整理解。红色段下面新增的音乐说明字号较小，快速扫过不一定能抓到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他在重新振作之后又意识到可能还要等待很久，逐渐平静下来，并决定无论以后有没有亲近的人，都要好好过自己的生活。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"不安、平静、释然、坚定\",\n      \"missed\": \"绿色段下面关于低音、和弦以及最后一个高音和弦的解释很难一眼抓到；紫色段关于装饰音带来不安、回落后终于能喘口气的细节也需要读。最后的音乐解释包含决定和从梦中醒来两种理解，一眼不容易发现。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 4,\n  \"main_problem\": \"四段大号文字同时出现，视觉权重比较接近，每段又包含多个意思，第一眼容易同时扫到怀念、振作、担忧、平静、珍惜等关键词，却不容易迅速确定当前最重要的一件事。尤其最后绿色段较长，既讲有人愿意亲近时如何珍惜，也讲一直没有时如何自处。好在四段之间有明确的情绪递进，想起过去、重新振作、担心等待、接受未来，彼此能够串起来；音乐说明也大体对应这条情绪变化线。主要问题是扫读负担，而不是内容之间缺乏联系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f98f225d-1b5f-460d-b7a1-e8e686052d68", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T002339552585Z", "elapsed_seconds": 83.109, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:25:02.660965+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d9d68b80bf9f403de7b33559ffb0f3fdab28e83cee77c9085668a5a51a4fb2b8", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T002339552585Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "ecea41585d43c58d757a8fc9f45f59b08ebfc196363803fb85c01dd9a1bcccca"}}}
